    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kanisa eyaabaire eri Antiokia hakaba harimu baanabi n'abeegyesa, Barunaba na Simeoni orikwetwa Niga na Lukio owa Kureene na Manaeni owaarezirwe hamwe n'Oweishaza Heroode, na Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baabaire nibaheereza Mukama nibeesiibyakwo, Omwoyo Orikwera yaagira ati: Muntooranire Barunaba na Saulo, bakore omurimo ogu mbeeteire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 14:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TI.4.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tim 4:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TI.5.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku baaherize kwesiibyakwo n'okushaba, baabataho engaro, baaboohereza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baatumirwe Omwoyo Orikwera, baashuuma Selukia; okwo baaragarirayo omu meeri, baayambuka Kupuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baabaire bari Salami, baabuurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga omuri sinagogi z'Abayudaaya; kandi bakaba baine Yohaana nk'omuhereza waabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baaherize kuraba omuri ekyo kirwa kyona, baahika Paafo; okwo baashangayo omushaija omurogi, nabi w'ebishuba, Omuyudaaya, orikwetwa Bayesu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi akaba atwire n'Oweishaza Omutegyeki, orikwetwa Serugiro Paulo, omushaija w'omunyabwengye. Ogwo yaayeta Barunaba na Saulo, naayenda kuhurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Eluma omurogi (ahakuba nigo makuru g'eiziina rye) yaabahakanisa, ngu abone kuhabisa Oweishaza ataikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Saulo, niwe Paulo, aijwire Omwoyo Orikwera, yaamutaho amaisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagira ati: Iwe oijwire obugobya bwona n'obubi bwona, iwe mwana wa Sitaane 'we, omuzigu w'okuhikiirira kwona, torireka kukiikamya emihanda ya Mukama egororokire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu hati omukono gwa Mukama nigukuhana, noija kuhuma, noomara omwanya otarikureeba mushana. Ahonaaho oruho n'omwirima byamushweka; yaabandagira, naasherura ow'okumwebembera amukwaitse omukono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga aho oweishaza, ku yaareebire ebyakorwa, yaikiriza, ahabw'okuba akatangaarira okwegyesa kwa Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Paulo n'abagyenzi be baaruga Paafo omu meeri, baayambuka, baahika Peruga ey'omuri Pamfulia. Yohaana yaabatsigayo, yaagaruka Yerusaalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwonka bo ku baahingwire nibaruga Peruga, baahika Antiokia ey'omuri Pisidia. Baataaha omuri sinagogi aha izooba rya Sabato, baashutama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.15.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 15:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'okushoma Ebiragiro n'ebya Baanabi, abakuru ba sinagogi baabeeta, baabagira bati: B'eishe-emwe, ku muraabe mwine ekigambo ky'okugumya abantu, mukigambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo nikwo kwimuka, akaimutsya omukono, naagira ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe bashaija ba Israeli 'mwe, naimwe abarikutiina Ruhanga, muhurire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga ow'eihanga eri ry'Israeli akatoorana baatatenkuriitwe, yaakuza abantu abo obu baabaire batwire omu nsi ya Misri; bwanyima yaabaihisayo omukono gw'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 14:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaamara emyaka nka makumi ana abagumisiririize omu ihamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.14.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 14:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaaherize kuhwerekyereza amahanga mushanju omu nsi ya Kanaani, yaabaha ensi yaabo kuba obuhunguzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 2:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 3:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baamarayo emyaka nka magana ana na makumi ataano; bwanyima y'ebyo yaabaha abaramuzi okuhitsya ahari nabi Samueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima baashaba omugabe; Ruhanga yaabaha Saulo mutabani wa Kiishi, ow'omuruganda rwa Benyamiini, yaabategyekyera emyaka makumi ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
